WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.737
Bountex turns small, useful tasks into NIM rewards.

00:00:03.737 --> 00:00:05.362
Good work pays.

00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:09.301
Find work in design, development, writing, research and

00:00:09.301 --> 00:00:12.633
community. Each bounty shows its reward, estimated time and

00:00:12.633 --> 00:00:13.387
deadline.

00:00:14.733 --> 00:00:18.425
Creators define the task, requirements and NIM reward.

00:00:18.425 --> 00:00:20.805
Rewards are offered, not escrowed.

00:00:20.805 --> 00:00:23.626
Creators pay directly after approving the work.

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:28.288
Workers read the mission and acceptance requirements, then

00:00:28.288 --> 00:00:30.866
claim a task. Their workspace keeps the work and

00:00:30.866 --> 00:00:32.073
its progress visible.

00:00:33.433 --> 00:00:36.626
Submit notes, a proof link or private attachments.

00:00:36.626 --> 00:00:39.261
Drafts are preserved, and the creator can review

00:00:39.261 --> 00:00:40.120
the evidence.

00:00:41.467 --> 00:00:44.230
Creators approve submissions, request a revision with a

00:00:44.230 --> 00:00:48.108
reason, or reject the work. Approval and payment have

00:00:48.108 --> 00:00:49.408
distinct statuses.

00:00:50.767 --> 00:00:53.461
This is a preview receipt. No NIM was

00:00:53.461 --> 00:00:56.920
sent. Live payouts stay pending until the backend matches

00:00:56.920 --> 00:00:59.486
the transaction and verifies a macro checkpoint.

00:01:01.100 --> 00:01:03.712
Bountex is open-source, and the hosted demo uses

00:01:03.712 --> 00:01:04.223
mainnet.
